 "as_of": "2026-10-05",
 "descriptor": "Metal flexible hoses and data-centre cooling skids",
 "lede": "India's largest maker of stainless-steel flexible hoses, exporting to 80+ countries, which has added liquid-cooling skids for AI data centres. Q1 FY27 revenue jumped 72%, but the skid business rests on one customer and the stock trades at over 100x earnings.",
 "market": {
  "price": 544,
  "mcap_cr": 7203,
